  "details": "Description\n\nsometimes when opening a world it will let me load in perfectly fine while most of the time it will say that there was a connection error and when i pull up my wifi my wifi is perfectly fine it is connected but for some reason it will not let me load into instances. recently i haven't even been able to play murder for because it won't let me load into any murder for instance. i would like some help on this issue because i would love to play my games but i can't because if it not letting me load into them \n\nReproduction Steps\n\nthe only way that i have figured out how to get around this issue is if i were to close out of vrchat and reopen it but a lot of the time that doesn't work so i need to shut my headset off and reset it but then that takes a lot of time and it's very annoying to have to reset my headset every hour, hour and a half? i would just really like some help on figuring out how i can resolve this issue.\n\nDetails\n\n- Category: Other\n\n- Frequency: Often\n\n---\n\nplatform: Quest (platform: Android - Quest, store: Oculus, headset: None)\n\nrawPlatform: Android\n\nclientVersion: 2026.3.2-1901-4a7d603ee0-Release\n\nunityVersion: 2022.3.22f2-DWR\n\nIn-Client Report\n\n---\n\n**Log file:** [output_log_2026-09-02_20-02-58.txt](https://api.vrchat.cloud/api/1/file/file_57549a8a-43b4-4f4c-9536-ca36f75b429f/1/file)",
